<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT WESTERN AUSTRALIA BY NINE WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT WESTERN AUSTRALIA BY NINE WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat Western</p>
<p>Australia by nine wickets on the third and final day of their</p>
<p>match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Western Australia 293-6 declared and 170. West</p>
<p>Indies 441-5 declared and 26-1.</p>
</text>
